# Data Platform Rules

data/sample may contain small simulated CSV fixtures.

data/sample files may be committed to GitHub.

data_store is for local real market data.

data_store real market data must not be committed to GitHub.

data/raw is a local staging layer.

data/processed is a local normalized output layer.

data/external is a local external reference layer.

data/raw, data/processed, and data/external should not contain committed real or licensed data.

Future real MO market data should land under data_store.

The main future minute quote path is:
data_store/quotes/minute/MO/{symbol}/{trade_date}.parquet

Quality state should be stored under:
data_store/quality/MO/{symbol}/{trade_date}.state.json

Do not implement data downloaders unless the current GitHub Issue explicitly allows it.

Do not create real parquet market data unless the current GitHub Issue explicitly allows it.

Do not commit large market data files.

Do not commit licensed market data.
